Updating the cpdbr service (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-08-20

You must upgrade the cpdbr service after you upgrade IBM® Software Hub.

Upgrade phase

        You are not here. Collecting required information
        You are not here. Updating your client workstation
        You are not here. Preparing to run an upgrade in a restricted network
