What to do next

Now that you've upgraded the cpdbr service, you're ready to complete Upgrading the IBM Software Hub configuration admission controller webhook (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3).

If you don't use the configuration admission controller webhook, see Upgrading privileged monitors (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3).
